  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0143_c453f1978b4f.jpg\" style=\"width: 187px; height: 202px;\" /><br /><br />For complete state equilibrium of the system. The state friction on the block <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> by&nbsp;the wall will balance the total weight <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>120</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> of the system."
  }
